# Color applet: palette, "Define Custom Colors..." (the modeless Custom Color Selector), hue 40,
# saturation 200 and luminosity 100 typed, "Add Color" (first custom box), Close. Same keys as
# arch311-ref/scn/color-custom.scn; compare in 16 colours (W16_COLORS=16). Frames 02-05 keep the
# edits' caret: the reference caught it on.
# regress: W16_COLORS=16 sh tools/run-cp-test.sh "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: color-custom/02.png 02.png active
# compare: color-custom/03.png 03.png active
# compare: color-custom/04.png 04.png active
# compare: color-custom/05.png 05.png active
# compare: color-custom/06.png 06.png active
# compare: color-custom/07.png 07.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
sleep 400
shot shots/01.png
key enter
key tab
key space
key tab
key tab
key tab
key space
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/02.png
key 4
key 0
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/03.png
key tab
key 2
key 0
key 0
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/04.png
key tab
key 1
key 0
key 0
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/05.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key space
sleep 400
shot shots/06.png
key tab
key space
sleep 400
shot shots/07.png
quit
